Where the files of this directory come from

v1/refsol.py, v1/utils.py
    The reference graders of MedAgentBench (https://github.com/stanfordmlgroup/MedAgentBench), copied from the GRASP
    repository (https://github.com/jomoll/GRASP, commit 9d7d125), which vendors them. MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025
    Stanford Machine Learning Group; the licence text is below.

v2/refsol.py, v2/utils.py
    The reference graders of MedAgentBench v2 (https://github.com/ericoericochen/medagentbenchv2), copied from the GRASP
    repository, which vendors them. They remain the work of their authors; see that repository for its terms.
    One change: task1 in v2/refsol.py takes the current time from the task context instead of the system clock
    (marked in the file).

v3/utils.py
    Adapted from the helpers of MedAgentBench v2 above.

../protocol.py
    The task prompt and the action parsing follow the MedAgentBench task server (MIT License, as above), which builds
    on AgentBench (https://github.com/THUDM/AgentBench, Apache License 2.0).

v1/refsol_partial.py, v2/refsol_partial.py, v3/refsol.py, v3/refsol_partial.py, every __init__.py
    Written for MedicalRSI, under the licence of this repository (../../../../LICENSE).

